# Czech: the rules the formant voice speaks it by (docs/tts.md,
# "Other languages"). Written from Czech spelling, close to one letter, one sound: the hooked letters, ě and the softening i, final devoicing. Stress: the first syllable.
name Czech
stress first
unstressed 2
vowels aáeéěiíoóuúůyý
weak a i v ve s se z ze k na o u do je to

